---
import Button from './Button.astro';
---
<section id="opening" class="opening-section container" aria-labelledby="opening-title">
  <div class="opening-intro"><span class="eyebrow">Made at our own pace</span><h2 id="opening-title" class="display-heading">Good things<br />take a little <em>time.</em></h2><p>We’re putting the finishing touches on our first collection. Until then, settle in and have a look around.</p><Button href="#collection" variant="secondary" arrow>Explore the preview</Button></div>
  <div class="opening-questions">
    <details open><summary>One piece at a time <span aria-hidden="true">+</span></summary><p>Every piece will be made by hand and finished before it finds its way here. Small batches, individual pieces, and plenty of room for whatever we feel like making next.</p></details>
    <details><summary>Completed in small batches <span aria-hidden="true">+</span></summary><p>When the shop opens, you’ll choose from pieces that are already complete. We won’t be taking custom orders or producing pieces on demand.</p></details>
    <details><summary>About this little preview <span aria-hidden="true">+</span></summary><p>The pieces shown here are coming-soon previews. Nothing is available to purchase yet, and no price appears until a finished small batch is officially released.</p></details>
    <details><summary>When can I shop? <span aria-hidden="true">+</span></summary><p>Our first collection is still coming together, and we haven’t set an opening date. Check back here for the finished pieces and details about ordering and delivery.</p></details>
  </div>
</section>
<style>
  .opening-section { padding-block: var(--space-section); display: grid; grid-template-columns: 1fr 1fr; gap: clamp(3rem, 8vw, 8rem); align-items: start; }
  .opening-intro h2 { margin-top: var(--space-5); }
  .opening-intro > p { max-width: 37ch; color: var(--color-muted); margin-block: var(--space-6) var(--space-8); }
  .opening-questions { border-top: 1px solid var(--color-border); }
  details { border-bottom: 1px solid var(--color-border); }
  summary { display: flex; list-style: none; justify-content: space-between; align-items: center; gap: var(--space-4); padding-block: var(--space-6); font-size: var(--text-base); }
  summary::-webkit-details-marker { display: none; }
  summary span { font-size: var(--text-xl); line-height: 1; transition: transform var(--duration-fast); }
  details[open] summary span { transform: rotate(45deg); }
  details p { color: var(--color-muted); font-size: var(--text-sm); line-height: 1.8; padding-right: var(--space-6); padding-bottom: var(--space-6); max-width: 60ch; }
  @media(max-width: 800px) { .opening-section { grid-template-columns: 1fr; } }
</style>
